ys rugby supports that sport. Missing credibility metadata is not wrong_argument. Return direct only for the requested relation; UK Albums Chart does not define the band or song whose debut is mentioned.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What sport is Justin Thomas associated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"sport\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 16, \"text\": \"Lee transferred.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d00\", \"start\": 17, \"end\": 130, \"text\": \"He went on to start all 14 games including the Orange Bowl victory against Mississippi State led by Dak Prescott.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d00\", \"start\": 131, \"end\": 264, \"text\": \"He was named the MVP of the game after he had 125 passing yards, a passing touchdown, 121 rushing yards and three rushing touchdowns.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d00\", \"start\": 265, \"end\": 396, \"text\": \"For the season, he passed for 1,719 yards and 18 touchdowns with six interceptions and rushed for 1,086 yards and eight touchdowns.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d00\", \"start\": 397, \"end\": 449, \"text\": \"The 2015 season was one that was marred by injuries.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d00\", \"start\": 450, \"end\": 493, \"text\": \"The team finished with a dismal 3-9 record.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d00\", \"start\": 494, \"end\": 583, \"text\": \"Thomas' most notable performance of the season was against then undefeated Florida State.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d00\", \"start\": 584, \"end\": 586, \"text\": \"He\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 16, \"text\": \"Lee transferred.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d01\", \"start\": 17, \"end\": 130, \"text\": \"He went on to start all 14 games including the Orange Bowl victory against Mississippi State led by Dak Prescott.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d01\", \"start\": 131, \"end\": 264, \"text\": \"He was named the MVP of the game after he had 125 passing yards, a passing touchdown, 121 rushing yards and three rushing touchdowns.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d01\", \"start\": 265, \"end\": 396, \"text\": \"For the season, he passed for 1,719 yards and 18 touchdowns with six interceptions and rushed for 1,086 yards and eight touchdowns.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d01\", \"start\": 397, \"end\": 449, \"text\": \"The 2015 season was one that was marred by injuries.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d01\", \"start\": 450, \"end\": 493, \"text\": \"The team finished with a dismal 3-9 record.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d01\", \"start\": 494, \"end\": 583, \"text\": \"Thomas' most notable performance of the season was against then undefeated Florida State.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d01\", \"start\": 584, \"end\": 763, \"text\": \"However, outside of football, Thomas is also known for his exceptional skills in golf, where he has won multiple tournaments and is considered one of the top players in the world.\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0007-61e4c3925342:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 199, \"text\": \"PRESS Viktor Hovland 's 'Disgusting ' Win At Valspar , JT Keeps It Classy In Defeat , Tiger Woods ' Hater Blockers Viktor Hovland earned a win at the Valspar